WEBVTT

00:25.741 --> 00:30.078
FOOL NIGHT

02:02.420 --> 02:04.756
Wait, a child was killed too?

02:04.840 --> 02:06.883
Don't know if the kid
was collateral damage,

02:06.967 --> 02:08.885
but it's happened before.

02:08.969 --> 02:11.304
It's only targeting the wealthy.

02:11.388 --> 02:13.181
We noticed other similarities, too.

02:21.189 --> 02:23.358
Their belongings got swiped.

02:24.151 --> 02:25.694
What did they have?

02:28.321 --> 02:29.322
Candy.

02:31.241 --> 02:34.911
These are all Spiriflora
without any bones or flesh.

02:34.995 --> 02:37.289
Clearly, the murderer has already escaped.

02:38.331 --> 02:40.959
Nobody told me
that some victims were children.

02:43.253 --> 02:44.254
Where's Toshiro?

02:45.088 --> 02:48.466
I haven't formally asked him
to assist the investigation yet.

02:48.550 --> 02:51.052
His superpower is only good for two years.

02:51.136 --> 02:52.971
Why are you so reluctant to use it?

02:54.472 --> 02:57.058
You want him to find the girl
in your locker, right?

02:58.226 --> 02:59.811
Why are you peeking inside?

03:01.354 --> 03:05.734
Ms. Kaori Kamiya's deposit
for hospitalization will be 100,000 yen.

03:36.598 --> 03:39.392
Why did it come to this?

03:43.647 --> 03:46.274
YOMIKO

03:47.317 --> 03:48.360
<i>What?</i>

03:48.443 --> 03:49.611
Hey…

03:50.779 --> 03:52.322
You went to see your mom, right?

03:53.323 --> 03:54.324
How did it go?

03:54.824 --> 03:57.994
<i>Yeah, she's being hospitalized.</i>

03:59.496 --> 04:00.580
<i>I see…</i>

04:01.248 --> 04:02.374
That's why you called?

04:02.874 --> 04:07.379
Well, actually, I'm assisting the police
with another case right now.

04:08.255 --> 04:10.882
I was wondering if you could help.

04:14.761 --> 04:17.555
And, yeah,
there's one more reason I called.

04:18.515 --> 04:20.558
This one's a personal request.

04:22.060 --> 04:24.312
<i>I want you to find someone I used to know.</i>

04:25.313 --> 04:27.774
<i>- A psycho who tried to go to Antarctica--</i>
- Sorry, I can't.

04:29.150 --> 04:30.902
<i>I don't have time for that.</i>

04:31.486 --> 04:35.365
I only have two years left
until I become a Spiriflor.

04:35.949 --> 04:38.159
Maybe I should think long and hard

04:38.243 --> 04:40.787
<i>about how to spend the rest of my days.</i>

04:42.122 --> 04:43.748
Did something happen?

04:44.666 --> 04:45.750
Sorry.

04:45.834 --> 04:48.795
I'll continue my work
with the Locator Division, though.

04:49.379 --> 04:51.965
<i>- Bye.</i>
- Hey, wait a minute!

04:53.216 --> 04:56.177
Not even for money? What if I pay you?

05:00.056 --> 05:01.057
<i>Sorry.</i>

05:01.725 --> 05:04.436
<i>Right now,</i>
<i>I'm just scared of running out of time.</i>

05:11.860 --> 05:13.445
ANTI-TRANSFLORATION
SIGN PETITION

05:19.075 --> 05:20.869
TRANSFLORA MEDICAL

05:40.764 --> 05:43.892
Do you know what I'm thinking right now?

05:44.934 --> 05:47.687
- I'm not slacking off.
- Take a good listen.

05:53.193 --> 05:55.862
I hear expectation and malice.

05:58.323 --> 06:00.450
I'm playing poker with some friends here.

06:00.533 --> 06:03.536
For some reason, I'm losing a ton lately.

06:03.620 --> 06:05.497
I can't even afford to clean my suit.

06:06.122 --> 06:09.209
All you have to do
is listen to the Spiriflora here,

06:09.292 --> 06:13.505
and tell me whenever the other players
think they're gonna win.

06:13.588 --> 06:16.216
- Like cheating?
- It's not cheating!

06:16.299 --> 06:18.927
To win, you gotta use
every resource available.

06:19.010 --> 06:20.095
That's cheating!

06:20.887 --> 06:22.472
If my hand seems stronger, tug once.

06:22.555 --> 06:25.475
If my hand seems weaker, tug twice.

06:26.351 --> 06:27.811
I'll cut you a share.

06:31.356 --> 06:33.817
Chief, is your heart content?

06:35.068 --> 06:38.655
What, do I seem that pathetic to you?

06:39.447 --> 06:42.242
I got less than two years to live, right?

06:42.992 --> 06:48.123
I'm feeling compelled to think
about the meaning of life, and stuff.

06:50.041 --> 06:52.335
Having fun isn't enough for you?

06:54.712 --> 06:56.881
Are you saying we're born
with some kind of purpose?

07:00.677 --> 07:01.678
Yeah.

07:03.138 --> 07:04.139
Probably.

07:07.684 --> 07:09.602
It's been a while, Yomiko.

07:10.186 --> 07:12.605
Chief brought me here against my will.

07:12.689 --> 07:15.275
Tough break for little Yomiko, eh?

07:15.358 --> 07:16.651
<i>Yomiko's here.</i>

07:17.277 --> 07:19.571
Want some of this, too, Kurakiri?

07:19.654 --> 07:21.489
What is it?

07:21.573 --> 07:25.535
Human-origin whiskey made from prisoners
who became malt after transfloration.

07:25.618 --> 07:27.370
I'll pass.

07:27.454 --> 07:30.540
Hey now, quit flaunting
your illegal goods, please.

07:30.623 --> 07:33.251
Tastes like Reptile Prison.

07:34.335 --> 07:36.004
By the way, Ms. Himejima,

07:36.087 --> 07:39.257
any updates on that murderer
who left no evidence behind?

07:39.841 --> 07:44.846
I'm fairly certain that the criminal
is a human undergoing transfloration.

07:44.929 --> 07:49.392
If the public finds out who did it,
anti-transfloration activists will riot.

07:49.976 --> 07:54.022
Surely, this won't put Transflora Medical
in jeopardy of shutting down,

07:54.606 --> 07:58.318
but I'd like to squash this
before it gets out of hand.

07:59.319 --> 08:03.323
So that was your ulterior motive
to help with the investigation.

08:04.240 --> 08:06.493
It's something I have to consider.

08:07.869 --> 08:11.498
I'm just wondering how a patient
so deep in transfloration

08:11.581 --> 08:16.252
could murder like that
despite having no traces of humanity left.

08:18.254 --> 08:21.716
By the way, have you asked
our superman for help yet?

08:22.300 --> 08:23.301
What?

08:23.384 --> 08:24.385
Toshiro.

08:25.720 --> 08:26.721
I apologize.

08:27.347 --> 08:29.682
He refused to assist the investigation.

08:30.183 --> 08:31.976
And your personal request, too?

08:32.977 --> 08:35.522
Your top priority
is finding that girl, right?

08:35.605 --> 08:36.773
Right.

08:36.856 --> 08:39.275
What? Are you looking for someone, Yomiko?

08:39.359 --> 08:40.568
Want me to help?

08:40.652 --> 08:42.237
It's beyond your skill level, Kurakiri.

08:43.321 --> 08:46.574
<i>Oh, it was that important to her?</i>

08:50.078 --> 08:51.079
I'm raising.

09:02.382 --> 09:04.300
KAORI & TOSHIRO KAMIYA

09:23.444 --> 09:26.239
ORAL MEDICATION
KAORI KAMIYA, THREE TIMES A DAY

09:32.453 --> 09:35.832
<i>Another day spent</i>
<i>without accomplishing anything.</i>

09:39.586 --> 09:40.587
<i>Meaning.</i>

09:42.380 --> 09:43.464
<i>Reason for living.</i>

09:44.257 --> 09:45.258
<i>Meaning…</i>

10:13.202 --> 10:15.371
SOBA NOODLES WITH SEAFOOD BROTH

10:37.185 --> 10:38.061
Mom.

10:38.645 --> 10:41.689
I finished my homework.
Let me play games now.

10:41.773 --> 10:43.733
No. Review it again.

10:43.816 --> 10:45.234
I reviewed it.

10:45.318 --> 10:47.695
You said that the other day
and had mistakes.

10:47.779 --> 10:50.615
Even though I send you to cram school
five times a week.

10:51.240 --> 10:53.618
You should be getting 100%
on all schoolwork.

10:55.078 --> 10:58.748
It's perfect this time, so I wanna play--

10:58.831 --> 10:59.874
Show me.

10:59.957 --> 11:02.377
If I see a mistake,
your game console's going in the trash.

11:04.003 --> 11:05.171
I'll go review it.

11:26.234 --> 11:27.527
What's with that kid?

11:31.155 --> 11:33.366
Good. Your work is perfect, too.

11:33.449 --> 11:34.742
The rest of you, take note.

11:36.202 --> 11:37.245
What a nerd.

11:37.787 --> 11:39.914
- She's a show-off.
- Teacher's pet.

11:39.997 --> 11:42.333
Anybody could do that
if they went to cram school.

11:42.417 --> 11:43.626
She's desperate, huh?

11:44.293 --> 11:46.462
I bet she peeked at the answers.

11:47.880 --> 11:50.550
Now, let's talk about cubic equations.

11:54.887 --> 11:56.973
According to my mom,

11:57.056 --> 12:01.018
These six years of elementary school can
determine the course of your entire life.

12:01.102 --> 12:05.398
To get a stable job,
you have to attend a national university.

12:05.481 --> 12:08.860
So, if you can't
get into Keio Junior High,

12:08.943 --> 12:13.197
you have to bank on either Seiko or Touo,
which are lower-level schools.

12:13.281 --> 12:17.326
Otherwise, you won't stand a chance
on national university entrance exams.

12:18.327 --> 12:20.621
Doing well in school is the bare minimum.

12:20.705 --> 12:23.499
If you can't get a perfect score
with the textbook right there,

12:23.583 --> 12:25.293
you have no future.

12:25.376 --> 12:27.170
Grow up to be useless adults
and die already.

12:31.716 --> 12:33.968
APOLOGY LETTER

12:34.552 --> 12:35.553
So stupid.

12:46.898 --> 12:48.691
I, YOMIKO HORAI…

12:50.735 --> 12:51.736
I'll just study.

12:52.528 --> 12:54.447
MATH II

12:55.907 --> 12:57.867
- What?
- Awesome!

12:57.950 --> 12:59.494
You got an advanced textbook!

12:59.577 --> 13:03.289
My mom would only buy me the intro one.

13:03.372 --> 13:06.125
The cover's all shiny. That's hella rare!

13:06.709 --> 13:09.295
<i>Some kids can't even buy textbooks?</i>

13:10.087 --> 13:11.631
Can I see it for a sec?

13:13.966 --> 13:16.177
Okay then, you can trade with me.

13:17.553 --> 13:18.554
Here.

13:25.937 --> 13:28.314
It's named "Horse Peace."
What do you think?

13:29.190 --> 13:33.194
JAPANESE

14:01.347 --> 14:03.933
Hey, wanna draw over the whole blackboard?

14:05.101 --> 14:07.478
I have to go now.

14:07.562 --> 14:09.355
What? But why?

14:12.608 --> 14:14.068
I had fun today.

14:14.652 --> 14:15.945
Let's play again tomorrow?

14:16.529 --> 14:17.572
I have cram school.

14:18.155 --> 14:18.990
The next day?

14:19.574 --> 14:20.533
Cram school.

14:21.367 --> 14:22.785
The day after that, too?

14:26.163 --> 14:27.540
When can we play, then?

14:28.708 --> 14:30.334
I probably can't play anymore.

14:31.085 --> 14:32.086
What's that mean?

14:33.546 --> 14:36.966
I have to work hard now
for an easier future, apparently.

14:37.592 --> 14:40.261
Are you doing anything
to secure your future?

14:41.053 --> 14:43.764
- Nope, nothing.
- Moron! That's suicide!

14:45.099 --> 14:47.393
The future's important. I know that.

14:48.436 --> 14:49.687
But…

14:50.271 --> 14:53.316
I also think the present
is just as important.

15:14.879 --> 15:16.130
<i>That's suicide!</i>

15:38.110 --> 15:40.363
Paper, paper…

15:54.961 --> 15:58.089
YOMIKO

16:34.750 --> 16:36.669
CONTACT LIST
TOSHIRO

16:49.306 --> 16:50.307
Yomiko.

16:51.976 --> 16:52.977
What is it?

16:53.477 --> 16:55.187
Nothing, but like…

16:56.188 --> 16:57.314
are you mad?

17:00.234 --> 17:01.360
I'm not mad at you.

17:02.278 --> 17:03.446
What were you doing?

17:07.950 --> 17:10.870
I'm helping the police
with a series of murders,

17:11.579 --> 17:13.581
and this is the only survivor.

17:14.165 --> 17:16.292
This is…

17:16.375 --> 17:18.627
The number of victims is still climbing.

17:18.711 --> 17:21.839
We need to hurry up
and capture this murderer.

17:27.178 --> 17:29.055
Should I give it a listen?

17:29.889 --> 17:31.098
You'll do that for me?

17:31.682 --> 17:34.977
Oh, right.
I guess you can't ask it questions…

17:36.645 --> 17:39.482
Actually, I was able to do it once before.

17:40.900 --> 17:43.444
- Could you leave the room?
- Why?

17:44.070 --> 17:47.323
Are you getting naked
for a stronger connection, or something?

17:47.406 --> 17:48.407
No.

17:49.492 --> 17:51.452
Fine, just keep quiet.

18:03.589 --> 18:06.133
Somebody murdered you.

18:06.717 --> 18:09.011
Do you remember who it was?

18:14.683 --> 18:16.227
It's really confused.

18:16.727 --> 18:19.855
It's screaming, crying,
and asking questions.

18:21.273 --> 18:24.068
Calm down, would you? Tell me slowly.

18:27.488 --> 18:28.531
"I was so…"

18:29.907 --> 18:32.326
"I was so happy."

18:34.370 --> 18:36.038
"And yet, this is how it ends?"

18:37.414 --> 18:38.541
"Why?"

18:40.501 --> 18:41.627
"Why…"

18:54.056 --> 18:55.724
Are you gonna tell the family?

18:56.642 --> 18:58.310
They wouldn't believe me.

19:01.063 --> 19:02.356
I freaked you out, didn't I?

19:05.568 --> 19:06.569
I'm sorry.

19:09.697 --> 19:12.575
Sorry, I didn't tell you
that I'm looking for someone.

19:13.868 --> 19:17.413
During your time here,
I just assumed you'd help me with it.

19:20.166 --> 19:22.209
I'm the one who should be sorry.

19:22.835 --> 19:26.422
I tried to use you for my own agenda.

19:28.465 --> 19:30.718
I forgot that two years could be so short.

19:32.720 --> 19:33.804
Well, so did I.

19:51.238 --> 19:52.573
Wanna get some food?

19:52.656 --> 19:54.992
Yeah, there's a place I wanted to try.

19:55.075 --> 19:56.827
Okay, sounds like a plan.

20:08.214 --> 20:09.423
<i>Die.</i>

20:14.803 --> 20:16.222
Yomiko!

20:25.272 --> 20:27.358
<i>Die. Die. Die.</i>

20:27.441 --> 20:29.193
<i>Die…</i>

20:29.276 --> 20:30.277
<i>You're dead.</i>

20:30.361 --> 20:31.278
<i>No, stop.</i>

20:31.362 --> 20:32.363
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

20:32.446 --> 20:33.739
<i>Stop.</i>

20:33.822 --> 20:35.449
<i>Poor thing.</i>

20:36.033 --> 20:37.034
<i>What is that?</i>

20:37.743 --> 20:38.744
<i>What the hell?</i>

20:38.827 --> 20:41.121
<i>A Spiriflor? How is it moving?</i>

20:46.543 --> 20:47.920
Run.

20:58.138 --> 21:01.308
<i>Ouch, my ears! What did she throw?</i>

21:01.392 --> 21:03.686
<i>I gotta find a crowd of people.</i>

21:03.769 --> 21:05.854
Yomiko! Yomiko!

21:05.938 --> 21:07.398
Damn it! Don't die on me!

21:09.692 --> 21:11.026
<i>Is it not chasing me?</i>

21:11.777 --> 21:14.822
<i>Nah, I sense a thirst to kill.</i>
<i>It's not gonna give up.</i>

21:16.115 --> 21:17.908
<i>It's gotta be hiding somewhere.</i>

21:19.535 --> 21:22.454
<i>But where? Where's it hiding?</i>

21:23.038 --> 21:26.583
<i>Listen for bloodlust!</i>
<i>Come on, lemme hear it!</i>

21:26.667 --> 21:28.627
<i>What's the point</i>
<i>if I can't hear when it matters?!</i>

21:29.628 --> 21:31.839
<i>I can do it. I can do it!</i>

21:31.922 --> 21:33.799
<i>I don't need my ears to hear them.</i>
<i>Just listen!</i>

21:34.466 --> 21:35.843
<i>I gotta listen!</i>

21:38.554 --> 21:39.680
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

22:14.923 --> 22:15.924
Whoa, there…

22:17.676 --> 22:18.927
Hospital…

23:49.935 --> 23:51.937
Subtitle translation by: Logan Lampkins
